# ChatShy nginx 镜像：托管前端 dist（豆奶 + 控制台）并反代后端 API
# 与后端 chatshy 镜像配合，见 podman-compose.yml。

# ---------- 阶段 1：前端 ----------
FROM docker.io/library/node:22-bookworm AS frontend-builder
RUN npm install -g pnpm@12
WORKDIR /build
COPY dounai/package.json dounai/pnpm-lock.yaml ./
RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
COPY dounai/ ./
RUN pnpm build
# 产物 /build/dist

# ---------- 阶段 2：nginx 运行时 ----------
FROM docker.io/library/nginx:1.27-bookworm AS runtime
RUN rm -f /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
COPY container/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/chatshy.conf
COPY --from=frontend-builder /build/dist /app/dounai/dist
